# Work Studio — operational records. Tracked deliberately (2026-08-21) so
# Work Objects sync between machines via ordinary git push/pull instead of
# a separate private channel. If a Work Object ever needs to stay off this
# repo's history (e.g. sensitivity: restricted content), exclude it by path
# explicitly rather than reverting this block wholesale.
# .work-studio/config.md is tracked (workspace identity)
.work-studio/adapter.lock

